# Offline pipeline only — never needed by the API or UI
# D4 (docs/DECISIONS.md): Gemini via the native google-genai SDK. Not the
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint — new "AQ."-prefixed API keys (the only kind
# Google issues as of Sept 2026) fail against that endpoint. No base URL
# needed; the SDK talks to the native API directly.
LLM_API_KEY=
# gemini-2.5-flash: free tier is workable at catalog scale (~2s/call, no
# daily-quota trouble seen). gemini-3.8-flash is newer/more capable but its
# free tier is 20 requests/day (confirmed from the API's own quota error,
# not an estimate) — fine for a handful of manual tries, not a batch run.
LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# API
ARTIFACTS_DIR=artifacts
FRONTEND_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173

# Frontend (build time)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
